   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## HunyuanImage 3.0 Instruct-Distil · image editing (1 to 3 images)\n\n**Model files** — from [HuggingFace](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil-ComfyUI), into these folders (one of the three model formats: W4A8 is the smallest and fastest):\n\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| [hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_w4a8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil-ComfyUI/blob/main/hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_w4a8.safetensors)<br>or [hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil-ComfyUI/blob/main/hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_int8_convrot.safetensors)<br>or [hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil-ComfyUI/blob/main/hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_bf16.safetensors) | `models/diffusion_models` |\n| [hunyuan_image_3_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil-ComfyUI/blob/main/vae/hunyuan_image_3_vae_fp16.safetensors) | `models/vae` |\n| [hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_siglip2_so400m_naflex.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil-ComfyUI/blob/main/clip_vision/hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_siglip2_so400m_naflex.safetensors) | `models/clip_vision` |\n| [hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_cot_head.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil-ComfyUI/blob/main/hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_cot_head.safetensors)<br>(only for Prompt Rewriting) | `models/diffusion_models` |\n\n**Settings:** **8 steps, cfg 1.0**, euler / simple, and **guidance 2.5** on the Guidance node. About 26 s for a 1024×1024 image on an RTX 4090.\n\n**How to use:** load your image, write the edit in **Image Encode** (\"make it winter\", \"turn it into a watercolour\"). To combine images, connect up to three: a new socket appears on Image Encode as you connect one, and the prompt can refer to \"the first image\", \"the second image\". The output keeps the first image's shape at about 1 megapixel (Scale Image to Total Pixels → Get Image Size); for a fixed size, wire a Resolutions node instead.\n\n**Tip:** use a different seed from the one that made the input image, or the edit can come out overcooked.\n\nNeeds a 24 GB GPU and about 50 GB of free system RAM; the model streams from RAM as it runs.\n\n---\n\nCustom Nodes and Workflow developed by **Pedro Marinho** · [x.com/PedroMarinhoDev](https://x.com/PedroMarinhoDev)\n\n[github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-HunyuanImage3](https://github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-HunyuanImage3)"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## HunyuanImage 3.0 Instruct-Distil · image editing (1 to 3 images)\n\n**Model files** — from [HuggingFace](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil-ComfyUI), into these folders (one of the three model formats: W4A8 is the smallest and fastest):\n\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| [hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_w4a8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil-ComfyUI/blob/main/hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_w4a8.safetensors)<br>or [hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil-ComfyUI/blob/main/hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_int8_convrot.safetensors)<br>or [hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil-ComfyUI/blob/main/hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_bf16.safetensors) | `models/diffusion_models` |\n| [hunyuan_image_3_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil-ComfyUI/blob/main/vae/hunyuan_image_3_vae_fp16.safetensors) | `models/vae` |\n| [hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_siglip2_so400m_naflex.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil-ComfyUI/blob/main/clip_vision/hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_siglip2_so400m_naflex.safetensors) | `models/clip_vision` |\n| [hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_cot_head.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct-Distil-ComfyUI/blob/main/hunyuan_image_3_instruct_distil_cot_head.safetensors)<br>(only for Prompt Rewriting) | `models/diffusion_models` |\n\n**Settings:** **8 steps, cfg 1.0**, euler / simple, and **guidance 2.5** on the Guidance node. About 26 s for a 1024×1024 image on an RTX 4090.\n\n**How to use:** load your image, write the edit in **Image Encode** (\"make it winter\", \"turn it into a watercolour\"). To combine images, connect up to three: a new socket appears on Image Encode as you connect one, and the prompt can refer to \"the first image\", \"the second image\". The output keeps the first image's shape at about 1 megapixel (Scale Image to Total Pixels → Get Image Size); for a fixed size, wire a Resolutions node instead.\n\n**Tip:** use a different seed from the one that made the input image, or the edit can come out overcooked.\n\nNeeds a 24 GB GPU and about 50 GB of free system RAM; the model streams from RAM as it runs.\n\n---\n\nCustom Nodes and Workflow developed by **Pedro Marinho** · [x.com/PedroMarinhoDev](https://x.com/PedroMarinhoDev)\n\n[github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-HunyuanImage3](https://github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-HunyuanImage3)"
   },
